**Abstract.** Technology Options: available or emerging capabilities considered for the System, rejected ones included, so the rationale is a selection rather than a justification. Main concept: Meaningful Connections. The morning-care options are listed separately.

= Concepts =

|=Page|=Options|=Status
|[[c1.1 Pepper, resident profiles and local server>>doc:1 Foundation.c1 Technology Options.c1\.1 Pepper, resident profiles and local server.WebHome]]|Selected: TECH-01 Pepper in the lounge; TECH-03 Presence sensing in residents' rooms, opt-in only; TECH-04 Local server, one instance per resident; TECH-05 Consent-gated matching; TECH-06 Resident profile for matching. Rejected: TECH-02 Pocket guide; TECH-07 Cloud speech and language services; TECH-08 Audio recording; TECH-09 Location and body sensing. Envisioned: TECH-18 Pepper with an on-device accelerator|**Current**
